{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Now I would have to continue my travel description. — I departed from Cassel on Saturday afternoon — my Englishman remained there, and I found myself from then on among entirely German countrymen, quite in the national spirit — and missed my beautiful, free Englishman all the more. — We were six (three on each seat), I was facing backwards — a student from Göttingen had and kept his seat No. 1 in the back, opposite me, unmoved —, we sat tightly, it was not for the best. — We soon reached the Lahn, and now followed this river constantly; beautiful, fertile"}}],"created":1795080185,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":129,"prompt_tokens":218,"total_tokens":347,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-ro1P8ffvCudL4dq0QM74kykVsB5WLpEt","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":218,"prompt_ms":386.596,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.7733761467889908,"prompt_per_second":563.8961603327505,"predicted_n":129,"predicted_ms":3032.793,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.6936953125,"predicted_per_second":42.20532031035418}}